WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
No injustice or enmity

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,840
I heard that your Qinglong Village has been very arrogant recently.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,240
The people surrounding our Shazhou City

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,360
How many people have been killed?

5
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,880
Nothing

6
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,400
Others framed us

7
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,240
We never do this kind of thing

8
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,600
You don't do this

9
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,120
I don’t know if it’s true

10
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,200
I'm going out to recruit new soldiers.

11
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,560
Gather the separated refugees around them back to Shazhou City

12
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:23,680
I saw a lot of people bitten by you along the way.

13
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,200
It's not your Qinglong Village's fault.

14
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,040
Who did it right?

15
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,160
it was me

16
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,480
I am the Xianwang Zuo of the Louju Army.

17
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,600
made me stay

18
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,800
The meaning is very simple

19
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,360
Kill all those people around your Shazhou City.

20
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,840
This leaves your Shazhou City with no way to replenish new troops.

21
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:38,960
And staring at you

22
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:42,560
Don't think that you will be safe once our army withdraws.

23
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,720
But now there are other things

24
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,160
I can't spare any time to deal with you

25
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,600
If you are smart, surrender to me immediately, otherwise

26
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,680
Anyway, you should die first before talking about it

27
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:54,540
good kill

28
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,300
Make you arrogant general

29
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:57,500
Let's kill him all

30
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:58,700
There are five sleeping over there

31
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,900
I solved them all one by one

32
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,320
Collect things here

33
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,480
By the way, clear out all their food.

34
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,600
Return to the city immediately
